-- What fee must I pay the medical referee for a cremation permit?
-- c086: a Monday morning.
#ASSERT `What fee must I pay the medical referee for a cremation permit` `as the arranger` `Monday to Friday` 10 EQUALS amount 89.10
#ASSERT `What fee must I pay the medical referee for a cremation permit` `as the arranger` `Monday to Friday` 10 EQUALS (`amount` (`What fee must I pay for the permit` `Monday to Friday` 10))
-- 5 pm is out of hours.
#ASSERT `What fee must I pay the medical referee for a cremation permit` `as the arranger` `Monday to Friday` 17 EQUALS amount 147.40
#ASSERT `What fee must I pay the medical referee for a cremation permit` `as the arranger` `Monday to Friday` 17 EQUALS (`amount` (`What fee must I pay for the permit` `Monday to Friday` 17))
#ASSERT `What fee must I pay the medical referee for a cremation permit` `as the family` `an unasked day` `an unasked number` EQUALS `does not arise for you`
#ASSERT `What fee must I pay the medical referee for a cremation permit` `as the crematorium` `an unasked day` `an unasked number` EQUALS `does not arise for you`
